          "UnitType": "1",
          "ActivateUnitConsumption": "2:1:10801005:5/2:1:10801004:8/",
          "describe": "Neural Drive unlocks the γ partition, initial γ computing power: <color=#F74848>4</color>\n\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>1</color>:\n· After actively attacking with Alter-Blade or <buf ID=173909>[Mystic Arc]</buf>, if the part hit is below <color=#F74848>15%</color> HP, triggers the <buf ID=900109>[Execution]</buf> effect, directly destroying that part after combat.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>4</color>:\n· AP Cap <color=#F74848>+1</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>7</color>:\n· [Configuration Shift 3] trigger count increases by <color=#F74848>+1</color> time per turn. When attacking, DMG calculation uses the highest pilot attribute.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>10</color>:\n· [Storm Symbiosis 1] part destruction threshold increases to <color=#F74848>25%</color> HP.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>13</color>:\n· Critical Hit chance and Critical Hit DMG of Alter-Blade and <buf ID=173909>[Mystic Arc]</buf> increase by <color=#F74848>10%</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>16</color>:\n· After using <buf ID=173904>[Configuration Shift]</buf>, refunds <color=#F74848>1</color> <buf ID=173903>[Shift Energy]</buf>. This effect can trigger <color=#F74848>2</color> times per turn.\n",
          "icon": "Icon_zoneskill_0004",
          "Status": 1,
          "weight": 2178
        },
