          "describe": "Neural Drive unlocks the γ partition\n\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>1</color>:\n· Machine Gun and <buf ID=173908>[Night Ember]</buf> bullet count <color=#F74848>+1</color>, additionally increasing by <color=#F74848>+1</color> after each action. This effect is reset at the end of turn.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>4</color>:\n· AP Cap <color=#F74848>+1</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>7</color>:\n· When destroying a target, additionally restore <color=#F74848>1</color> AP after combat, effective up to <color=#F74848>2</color> times per turn.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>10</color>:\n· Machine Gun and <buf ID=173908>[Night Ember]</buf> range <color=#F74848>+1</color>. While in <buf ID=173901>[Cruise Form]</buf>, <buf ID=173908>[Night Ember]</buf> attacks ignore low obstacles.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>13</color>:\n· Machine Gun and <buf ID=173908>[Night Ember]</buf> Final DMG dealt increases by <color=#F74848>10%</color>.\nAt computing power <color=#F74848>16</color>:\n· After an action, the AP cost of the next action is reduced by <color=#F74848>1</color>, to a minimum of <color=#F74848>1</color>. This effect can trigger <color=#F74848>2</color> times per turn.\n",
